									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thealienbaby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4874276); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4874276&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606030425" alt="TheAlienBaby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4874276)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thealienbaby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4874276); return false;" >TheAlienBaby</a></span> <span class="odate time_1606027015 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">22 Nov 2020 06:36</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
