<p>Are the people who use the pen conscious?</p>
<p>*Yes, they are just unaware of what they are writing. They think they are writing, say a letter to a loved one, only to put the pen down and see that the words they had thought they were writing are not their own. They are not in any type of trance and can be interacted with normally.</p>
<p>-Why the euphoric feeling?</p>
<p>*I'm mostly going off personal observations of people who have been through shocking events. Some people will lose all sense of self while others oddly chase that numbing feeling. I can try to figure out a way to better describe it.</p>
<p>-Sudden tone change?</p>
<p>*I'm unsure of what you mean by that. I feel the tone is consistent. However if you could explain it to me maybe I could see it your way. Also I would like to delve into the cult stuff a bit, since it's name is derived from it being worshiped.</p>
<p>Thank you for looking at it!</p>
<p>I hope you have a good one!<br />
